  "title": "Gentex Foundation Awards $20,000 STEM Scholarship to Forest Hills Eastern High School Student",
  "summary": "The Gentex Foundation has selected Shriya Nallan Chakravarthi as the 2026 recipient of the Amanda Clark Scholarship, which supports female students pursuing science, technology, engineering, or math (STEM) degrees. Shriya, a senior at Forest Hills Eastern High School, plans to major in computer engineering at the University of Michigan and will receive a $5,000 scholarship for the 2026–2027 school year.",
